# 6
#title fix: CI-sized test timeouts and two workers on CI
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/6
#branch fix/ci-test-timeouts
#base main
#opened 2026-11-06
#head 1b779e14c77d21ced5e7138acbcafd5fc2be5b19
#describe what The CI test run had seven CPU-heavy tests time out at 5 s on the 2-vCPU runner. Timeouts are now realistic and CI uses two workers.
#describe before Default 5 s per test and up to 6 workers on every machine.
#describe after 30 s defaults and 2 workers on CI, 15 s and 6 workers locally; seven heavy tests have an explicit 60 s timeout.
#describe verified Typecheck and lint pass, and the CI-mode suite passes; the final proof is the CI run on this pull request.
